🍔 Foodie — Food Delivery Website

Foodie is a responsive food delivery website where users can browse food,
add items to cart, manage quantities, enter delivery address,
and complete demo checkout with UPI QR, Card or Cash on Delivery.

🚀 Features

• User Login & Delivery Address
• Food Menu with Categories
• Add to Cart & Quantity Management
• Saved Delivery Address
• UPI QR, Card & Cash on Delivery
• Order Confirmation
• Responsive Design

🛠️ Tech Stack

Frontend: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript
Icons: Font Awesome
Payment: UPI QR Code API
Backend: Node.js, Express
Database: PostgreSQL

📂 Project Files

